No licence, express or implied, is granted to use, copy, modify, merge,
publish, distribute, sublicense or sell any part of the proprietary content.
Its presence in a public repository is for transparency and does not place it
in the public domain or grant any right to reuse it.

Anything added to this repository in future is proprietary unless it is placed
in one of the directories listed in section 1, or this file is amended to say
otherwise.


3. THE MIT LICENCE
------------------

Applies only to the directories listed in section 1.

